1
00:00:01,783 --> 00:00:05,029
Crossing mountains and crossing valleys

2
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:08,596
A ninja's body is like a plane, flying freely through the sky

3
00:00:08,848 --> 00:00:12,281
Honest and kind, Hattori-kun is loved by all

4
00:00:12,435 --> 00:00:15,615
With eyes opened wide and round, tiny mouth held shut

5
00:00:15,948 --> 00:00:19,349
Face hidden beneath a mask, cheeks all puffed up

6
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:22,673
Catching villains with agile moves, lightning fast

7
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:26,440
Tricking bad guys with quirky moves, just like magic

8
00:00:26,793 --> 00:00:29,819
Speaking like poetry, polite yet spirited

9
00:00:30,944 --> 00:00:33,481
"I am Ninja Hattori-kun"

10
00:00:50,492 --> 00:00:52,002
Wow, awesome... A hit!

11
00:00:52,043 --> 00:00:53,435
Oh, nice!

12
00:00:53,476 --> 00:00:55,445
Oh no, an enemy! Watch out!

13
00:00:55,574 --> 00:00:56,908
Don't worry, it's fine

14
00:00:56,949 --> 00:00:59,521
How could I not worry? They're so tough!

15
00:00:59,562 --> 00:01:01,390
That's just child's play

16
00:01:01,430 --> 00:01:02,895
Ugh, you're so nagging

17
00:01:02,935 --> 00:01:04,188
I wasn't even talking to you guys

18
00:01:10,206 --> 00:01:12,997
Who... who are you?

19
00:01:14,361 --> 00:01:17,699
I am Ninja Hattori-kun, pleased to make your acquaintance

20
00:01:17,888 --> 00:01:19,993
But how... how did you get in here?

21
00:01:20,034 --> 00:01:21,260
How did you get in?

22
00:01:21,653 --> 00:01:23,772
Tell me, where did you come in from?

23
00:01:26,483 --> 00:01:28,123
I came in from this way

24
00:01:29,222 --> 00:01:30,586
You came through the window?

25
00:01:31,712 --> 00:01:33,677
That means you're a burglar!

26
00:01:33,718 --> 00:01:36,311
Oh... Please don't misunderstand

27
00:01:36,352 --> 00:01:38,503
I am a ninja, not a burglar

28
00:01:38,544 --> 00:01:41,045
A nin... ninja? Like the ninjas on TV?

29
00:01:41,086 --> 00:01:42,206
Is that for real?

30
00:01:42,247 --> 00:01:45,124
Kenichi, who are you talking to?

31
00:01:45,397 --> 00:01:46,691
Mom is coming!

32
00:01:47,124 --> 00:01:49,399
Let me introduce you, this is Hattori-kun...

33
00:01:49,696 --> 00:01:50,728
Kenichi

34
00:01:50,769 --> 00:01:52,085
There's no one here at all

35
00:01:52,126 --> 00:01:53,659
What? No one's here?

36
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:55,211
Huh... Why?

37
00:01:55,285 --> 00:01:57,125
Where did he go? Oh man...

38
00:01:57,166 --> 00:01:57,983
That's so weird

39
00:01:58,024 --> 00:02:00,113
Stop playing jokes on me, go to sleep right now

40
00:02:00,154 --> 00:02:02,173
That makes no sense, I clearly saw him just now

41
00:02:02,214 --> 00:02:03,681
You've watched way too much TV

42
00:02:03,721 --> 00:02:05,261
Alright, go to sleep now

43
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,589
Huh, how could it be so strange?

44
00:02:11,054 --> 00:02:12,978
Aah, Mom!

45
00:02:13,019 --> 00:02:14,581
He's back again!

46
00:02:15,928 --> 00:02:16,720
Mom!

47
00:02:16,761 --> 00:02:18,574
Why aren't you sleeping, shouting like that again?

48
00:02:18,615 --> 00:02:19,529
He showed up again!

49
00:02:19,569 --> 00:02:21,448
- I really did see him!
- Where is he?

50
00:02:21,522 --> 00:02:22,708
Look, over there!

51
00:02:24,119 --> 00:02:25,649
Whose child is he?

52
00:02:25,690 --> 00:02:26,367
I don't know

53
00:02:26,408 --> 00:02:27,944
Little boy, you should head home quickly

54
00:02:27,984 --> 00:02:29,881
Otherwise, your family will be worried sick

55
00:02:33,779 --> 00:02:35,046
Do you understand?

56
00:02:35,339 --> 00:02:36,550
I understand

57
00:02:36,591 --> 00:02:38,880
Mom, Hattori-kun says his hometown is Iga

58
00:02:38,921 --> 00:02:39,974
Huh, Iga?

59
00:02:41,414 --> 00:02:43,167
He's asking if he could stay here for the night

60
00:02:43,208 --> 00:02:44,261
I suppose we have no choice

61
00:02:44,301 --> 00:02:46,391
How can we tell him to leave when it's this late?

62
00:02:46,953 --> 00:02:48,026
Say thank you to him

63
00:02:49,332 --> 00:02:52,119
He says he's very grateful to you, Mom

64
00:02:53,715 --> 00:02:55,712
Hey, come sleep down here, it's safer

65
00:02:55,753 --> 00:02:58,072
I think sleeping like this is the most comfortable

66
00:02:58,113 --> 00:02:59,832
Oh well, suit yourself then

67
00:03:07,433 --> 00:03:09,420
Ah, Ninja Hattori-kun

68
00:03:09,461 --> 00:03:11,528
Oh dear... he's gone?

69
00:03:11,813 --> 00:03:15,047
Woah, sleeping on the ceiling can't be comfortable anyway

70
00:03:15,228 --> 00:03:16,628
Let's just let him sleep a bit longer

71
00:03:16,715 --> 00:03:18,008
Quietly now

72
00:03:18,518 --> 00:03:20,352
One, two, three, four

73
00:03:20,528 --> 00:03:22,648
Early to bed and early to rise not only keeps you healthy

74
00:03:22,689 --> 00:03:24,344
It leaves you feeling extra refreshed too!

75
00:03:24,385 --> 00:03:26,844
Woah...

76
00:03:28,503 --> 00:03:29,931
Hurry, out of the way!

77
00:03:29,971 --> 00:03:30,737
Oh no, Mom!

78
00:03:30,778 --> 00:03:32,836
-Why did you wax the floor so slippery?
-I didn't wax it at all!

79
00:03:32,877 --> 00:03:34,043
Hey, then who waxed it?

80
00:03:34,090 --> 00:03:35,456
Oh dear, I find it so strange

81
00:03:35,503 --> 00:03:38,294
When I woke up this morning, the whole house was already cleaned spotless

82
00:03:38,334 --> 00:03:39,007
Not only that

83
00:03:39,048 --> 00:03:41,262
Breakfast was already made without me lifting a finger

84
00:03:41,303 --> 00:03:43,369
And all the clothes were washed clean too!

85
00:03:43,423 --> 00:03:44,863
Then who on earth did all this?

86
00:03:45,574 --> 00:03:47,556
Kenichi

87
00:03:52,737 --> 00:03:54,117
Oh dear, what's all this?

88
00:03:54,523 --> 00:03:55,923
Mom, I know!

89
00:03:55,990 --> 00:03:58,658
As I thought, Hattori-kun did all our chores for us!

90
00:03:58,698 --> 00:03:59,747
Really, Hattori-kun?

91
00:03:59,788 --> 00:04:01,019
Who on earth is Hattori-kun?

92
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:03,601
He's a ninja from Iga, his name is Hattori-kun

93
00:04:03,642 --> 00:04:05,668
Where did that kid go now?

94
00:04:06,277 --> 00:04:09,234
Hey, Hattori-kun! Hattori-kun!

95
00:04:09,275 --> 00:04:10,161
Hey, Mom

96
00:04:10,201 --> 00:04:12,033
I don't care if he's Hattori-kun or Fattori-kun

97
00:04:12,074 --> 00:04:13,540
Bottom line is, if someone's staying the night

98
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:15,042
You have to tell me first

99
00:04:15,347 --> 00:04:17,979
Dad, you were out playing mahjong until late last night

100
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:19,428
When would we have had the chance to tell you?

101
00:04:19,528 --> 00:04:20,282
That's true...

102
00:04:20,422 --> 00:04:21,188
That's right

103
00:04:21,374 --> 00:04:23,100
And I had a bit of a stomachache last night too

104
00:04:25,741 --> 00:04:26,874
What's that? Hey...

105
00:04:27,239 --> 00:04:28,828
Oh no, there's a leak!

106
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,333
Really?

107
00:04:30,374 --> 00:04:31,613
How could there be a leak?

108
00:04:31,672 --> 00:04:34,552
Right, the weather is so nice, there's no way it's raining

109
00:04:35,079 --> 00:04:35,879
What's going on?

110
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:36,827
What is it?

111
00:04:38,854 --> 00:04:40,598
Oh dear, that Hattori-kun you were talking about...

112
00:04:40,639 --> 00:04:41,707
Is it this kid?

113
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:47,600
He's washing the house!

114
00:04:53,970 --> 00:04:56,105
-Woah!
-Oh dear, be careful!

115
00:05:00,442 --> 00:05:02,426
Oh my, you'd better be careful!

116
00:05:04,970 --> 00:05:07,060
Now, you... don't move from there, okay?

117
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:08,660
I... I'm coming to save you!

118
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:09,970
Whatever you do, don't move, I'm com...

119
00:05:15,082 --> 00:05:16,835
Oh, thank you so much!

120
00:05:17,567 --> 00:05:20,074
Now, what on earth should I do?

121
00:05:20,216 --> 00:05:21,596
The way I see it

122
00:05:21,636 --> 00:05:23,626
we'd better call the police, don't you think?

123
00:05:23,672 --> 00:05:25,280
Why make such a big fuss?

124
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:27,013
He only just got here, after all

125
00:05:27,053 --> 00:05:29,371
Still, Hattori-kun's family must be worried sick about him

126
00:05:29,412 --> 00:05:30,932
not knowing where he's gone

127
00:05:31,064 --> 00:05:33,102
Come on, today's Sunday

128
00:05:33,142 --> 00:05:35,307
We shouldn't go bothering the police

129
00:05:35,348 --> 00:05:37,751
So why not just let him stay a couple more days?

130
00:05:44,262 --> 00:05:46,124
I'm sure it won't be a problem

131
00:05:47,817 --> 00:05:50,308
Hey, are you sleeping on the ceiling again tonight?

132
00:05:50,349 --> 00:05:53,076
To be honest, this method really suits me

133
00:05:53,210 --> 00:05:53,842
Excuse me then

134
00:05:53,883 --> 00:05:54,850
Hey... wait a minute

135
00:05:54,890 --> 00:05:57,420
With you sleeping like that, I'll be too worried to fall asleep

136
00:05:57,461 --> 00:05:59,540
You at least need a blanket, don't you?

137
00:05:59,873 --> 00:06:00,780
A blanket?

138
00:06:02,533 --> 00:06:04,596
That way I can sleep in peace

139
00:06:07,983 --> 00:06:09,126
Goodnight

140
00:06:12,866 --> 00:06:15,320
Yan... I must endure, no matter what

141
00:06:17,126 --> 00:06:19,612
How did you pee in the shape of a shuriken?

142
00:06:19,653 --> 00:06:20,760
How embarrassing

143
00:06:21,187 --> 00:06:24,620
Even the way a ninja pees is truly one of a kind

144
00:06:28,196 --> 00:06:30,097
"The Obnoxious Teacher"

145
00:06:40,848 --> 00:06:41,768
Yan...

146
00:06:42,982 --> 00:06:45,140
Kenichi, what's the matter?

147
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,588
Oh, Hattori-kun

148
00:06:46,628 --> 00:06:48,421
I'm in big trouble now, I got carried away playing yesterday

149
00:06:48,461 --> 00:06:50,261
and forgot to do my homework

150
00:06:50,302 --> 00:06:51,347
Homework?

151
00:06:51,388 --> 00:06:52,815
What's that?

152
00:06:52,855 --> 00:06:55,021
Ugh, school assignments, you know

153
00:06:55,161 --> 00:06:57,540
Hattori-kun, you've got it so easy

154
00:06:57,580 --> 00:07:00,507
Not having to worry about schoolwork or homework at all must be wonderful

155
00:07:00,548 --> 00:07:01,820
Speaking of which

156
00:07:01,860 --> 00:07:04,141
what happens if you don't do your homework?

157
00:07:04,182 --> 00:07:06,308
The teacher will yell your head off

158
00:07:06,615 --> 00:07:07,481
"You lazy bum!

159
00:07:07,522 --> 00:07:08,708
Stand in the hall for an hour!"

160
00:07:08,749 --> 00:07:11,842
Ugh, just thinking of his face terrifies me

161
00:07:11,894 --> 00:07:12,970
That's hilarious

162
00:07:13,011 --> 00:07:14,495
No matter how much your mom and dad scold you

163
00:07:14,536 --> 00:07:16,609
you just shrug it off and don't care at all

164
00:07:16,650 --> 00:07:18,940
Yet the teacher scares you out of your wits

165
00:07:18,986 --> 00:07:20,857
This teacher must be really strict

166
00:07:20,971 --> 00:07:22,591
Kenichi

167
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:24,180
Do you know what time it is?

168
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:25,740
You're going to be late!

169
00:07:25,781 --> 00:07:27,475
Oh no, this is terrible!

170
00:07:27,775 --> 00:07:29,508
Hurry...

171
00:07:29,548 --> 00:07:31,828
Oh man, I've gotta get to school!

172
00:07:33,717 --> 00:07:34,978
I heard you have a runaway kid

173
00:07:35,018 --> 00:07:36,658
staying at your house, is that right?

174
00:07:37,495 --> 00:07:40,069
Mom, did you report Hattori-kun to the police?

175
00:07:40,109 --> 00:07:43,162
Yes, your dad said we should notify the police station

176
00:07:43,203 --> 00:07:45,125
Why would you do that?

177
00:07:45,245 --> 00:07:48,042
Since they haven't found where he lives yet, he can stay for now

178
00:07:48,082 --> 00:07:49,015
It won't be that simple

179
00:07:49,056 --> 00:07:50,580
If the police find out he's here

180
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:52,523
they'll definitely take him back to the station

181
00:07:52,563 --> 00:07:54,696
All right, stop arguing, you two

182
00:07:54,737 --> 00:07:57,596
I heard he comes from an area famous for ginseng, right?

183
00:07:58,676 --> 00:08:00,663
It's not an area famous for ginseng

184
00:08:00,704 --> 00:08:01,928
It's the homeland of the ninja

185
00:08:01,969 --> 00:08:03,129
All right, that's enough

186
00:08:03,169 --> 00:08:04,682
Can I meet this kid?

187
00:08:04,723 --> 00:08:06,189
He's standing right behind you

188
00:08:06,230 --> 00:08:06,930
Behind me?

189
00:08:07,183 --> 00:08:08,629
Now he's in front of you

190
00:08:12,757 --> 00:08:14,071
Up above!

191
00:08:14,111 --> 00:08:15,151
Oh, all right

192
00:08:15,223 --> 00:08:17,380
Stop joking around with me, okay?

193
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:19,288
He really is above you

194
00:08:19,329 --> 00:08:20,769
If you two keep pranking me

195
00:08:20,810 --> 00:08:22,269
I'm going to get mad

196
00:08:22,310 --> 00:08:24,083
Look, he really is on your head!

197
00:08:25,146 --> 00:08:27,280
All right, I hope this is the last time

198
00:08:29,863 --> 00:08:31,643
Argh, this is infuriating!

199
00:08:31,683 --> 00:08:33,542
That does it, I'm getting mad!

200
00:08:39,088 --> 00:08:41,308
Hattori-kun, where did you get that gun?

201
00:08:41,508 --> 00:08:44,588
I took it from that police officer earlier

202
00:08:44,628 --> 00:08:46,653
Guns are really dangerous!

203
00:08:46,694 --> 00:08:48,501
Hurry and give it back to the officer

204
00:08:48,690 --> 00:08:50,044
Then you return it to him

205
00:08:52,372 --> 00:08:54,125
Mom, I'm going to return it to him

206
00:08:57,241 --> 00:08:58,115
Kenichi

207
00:08:58,874 --> 00:08:59,795
Sir...

208
00:09:00,015 --> 00:09:01,523
You're still here at this time?

209
00:09:01,563 --> 00:09:02,360
Aren't you worried you'll be late?

210
00:09:02,401 --> 00:09:03,160
Oh, right

211
00:09:04,306 --> 00:09:05,300
What are you hiding?

212
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:06,179
Let me see

213
00:09:06,372 --> 00:09:07,500
N-Nothing...

214
00:09:07,540 --> 00:09:09,852
How could you bring something like this to school to play with?

215
00:09:09,892 --> 00:09:12,290
Outrageous, it looks just like a real one

216
00:09:13,816 --> 00:09:15,349
You could easily scare someone to death

217
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,342
Ridiculous!

218
00:09:16,929 --> 00:09:17,603
Whoa!

219
00:09:19,256 --> 00:09:21,249
Wait, it's actually a real gun?

220
00:09:23,700 --> 00:09:25,466
Hey, where did you get this gun from?

221
00:09:25,507 --> 00:09:27,321
Speak up, where did you get it?

222
00:09:27,361 --> 00:09:28,683
I only...

223
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:31,442
Don't say another word, I need to take the initiative...

224
00:09:31,483 --> 00:09:32,966
Where's my gun? Where could it be? Oh no...

225
00:09:33,106 --> 00:09:34,024
Excuse me, Officer

226
00:09:34,065 --> 00:09:36,680
You left your gun at my house earlier

227
00:09:36,872 --> 00:09:38,342
A police officer leaving his gun behind...

228
00:09:38,383 --> 00:09:40,068
That's completely careless and totally improper

229
00:09:40,109 --> 00:09:42,076
I'm so sorry, Sir, please forgive me!

230
00:09:43,481 --> 00:09:45,537
Kenichi, if you don't head to school you'll be late

231
00:09:45,684 --> 00:09:47,980
No matter how fast I run, I'm going to be late today anyway

232
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:49,251
Hey, Hattori-kun

233
00:09:49,291 --> 00:09:51,260
You can't follow me to school

234
00:09:51,513 --> 00:09:52,367
What's going on?

235
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:54,965
Nothing... I was just talking to myself

236
00:09:57,927 --> 00:09:58,838
What's his problem?

237
00:10:01,564 --> 00:10:03,558
Hey, I told you to go home! Why haven't you left?

238
00:10:03,598 --> 00:10:04,850
Hey, what are you muttering about now?

239
00:10:04,984 --> 00:10:06,283
N-Nothing, Teacher

240
00:10:06,324 --> 00:10:08,020
I... I said if I don't hurry back I'll be late!

241
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:09,412
Hey, Kenichi, hold on

242
00:10:09,453 --> 00:10:11,393
You have to take your shadow with you

243
00:10:13,992 --> 00:10:17,325
Aahh... Help! Aahh...

244
00:10:17,365 --> 00:10:18,725
Hold on, Teacher!

245
00:10:30,782 --> 00:10:33,162
Good morning, class

246
00:10:33,535 --> 00:10:35,463
Teacher, it's not morning anymore

247
00:10:35,503 --> 00:10:37,643
You're 30 minutes late

248
00:10:40,030 --> 00:10:40,980
Hey, Kenichi

249
00:10:41,021 --> 00:10:43,308
You're 30 minutes late, hurry and sit down

250
00:10:43,408 --> 00:10:44,680
Good morning, Yumeko

251
00:10:44,721 --> 00:10:46,620
Kenichi, why are you in such a rush?

252
00:10:46,660 --> 00:10:48,231
It's a long story

253
00:10:48,639 --> 00:10:49,799
Yan...

254
00:10:49,905 --> 00:10:51,685
All right, everyone take out your homework

255
00:10:53,545 --> 00:10:55,872
I wonder where Hattori-kun is right now

256
00:10:57,052 --> 00:10:58,145
I'm right here

257
00:10:58,186 --> 00:10:59,585
Hattori-kun!

258
00:11:02,025 --> 00:11:03,726
Kenichi, where's your homework?

259
00:11:03,905 --> 00:11:05,192
I forgot to do it

260
00:11:05,232 --> 00:11:05,971
What?

261
00:11:06,110 --> 00:11:07,272
Stand in the back for ten minutes!

262
00:11:07,418 --> 00:11:10,625
Huh, this teacher is so mean, always picking on Kenichi?

263
00:11:10,666 --> 00:11:13,159
Unacceptable! I must enforce justice!

264
00:11:13,732 --> 00:11:14,752
Aah!

265
00:11:21,653 --> 00:11:22,680
What is that?

266
00:11:35,229 --> 00:11:36,736
Where is the teacher?

267
00:11:37,783 --> 00:11:39,077
Help!

268
00:11:39,515 --> 00:11:40,964
Who tied me to this tree?

269
00:11:41,005 --> 00:11:42,562
How wicked!

270
00:11:43,343 --> 00:11:45,749
Let me down...

271
00:11:45,790 --> 00:11:48,103
- Oh no, this is bad...
- Hattori-kun!

272
00:11:48,143 --> 00:11:50,543
Actually, the teacher isn't a bad person

273
00:11:50,584 --> 00:11:53,324
He only punished me because I didn't do my homework

274
00:11:53,370 --> 00:11:55,598
Oh, is that so?

275
00:11:57,950 --> 00:11:59,200
From what you're saying

276
00:11:59,241 --> 00:12:00,567
you should be punished

277
00:12:00,608 --> 00:12:01,993
Because you had it coming!

278
00:12:02,199 --> 00:12:03,139
Y-You're right

279
00:12:03,185 --> 00:12:04,831
I totally agree with that

280
00:12:04,985 --> 00:12:06,732
B-But let's let it slide this time

281
00:12:06,772 --> 00:12:08,218
Don't take it so seriously, okay?

282
00:12:09,857 --> 00:12:11,342
There's no running away for you

283
00:12:14,444 --> 00:12:16,337
Spare me, hey...

284
00:12:17,231 --> 00:12:19,218
You reap what you sow

285
00:12:19,258 --> 00:12:21,057
Spare the rod and spoil the child!

286
00:12:24,829 --> 00:12:27,562
"Making Extra Cash Isn't Easy"

287
00:12:34,119 --> 00:12:35,879
I want to buy a model locomotive

288
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,546
But I'm still short a lot of money

289
00:12:37,666 --> 00:12:39,485
Ah, that's right!

290
00:12:39,878 --> 00:12:41,252
Yan...

291
00:12:41,778 --> 00:12:43,060
Hey, Hattori-kun

292
00:12:43,101 --> 00:12:44,419
Have you spent all your allowance?

293
00:12:44,525 --> 00:12:45,698
Allowance?

294
00:12:45,978 --> 00:12:48,377
You mean those pieces of paper Dad gave me?

295
00:12:48,418 --> 00:12:49,740
I didn't even know that was allowance

296
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:50,890
Here, I still have them

297
00:12:51,110 --> 00:12:52,848
That's right, that's it!

298
00:12:53,162 --> 00:12:55,729
Wow, it's great that you haven't spent any of your pocket money!

299
00:12:56,250 --> 00:12:56,850
Hattori-kun

300
00:12:56,890 --> 00:12:58,602
Could you lend it to me for now?

301
00:12:58,936 --> 00:12:59,903
Sure, I don't mind

302
00:13:00,150 --> 00:13:01,443
Great! Thank you!

303
00:13:01,503 --> 00:13:02,323
Yay!

304
00:13:03,610 --> 00:13:04,310
Huh?

305
00:13:05,023 --> 00:13:06,488
You can't do that

306
00:13:06,610 --> 00:13:08,461
I... I'll pay him back!

307
00:13:08,501 --> 00:13:09,414
Still no

308
00:13:09,580 --> 00:13:10,447
Because with this money...

309
00:13:10,488 --> 00:13:13,207
I'm going to open a bank account for Hattori-kun and save it up

310
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:14,493
No way!

311
00:13:15,746 --> 00:13:18,459
I was so close to buying that model locomotive!

312
00:13:22,559 --> 00:13:24,146
Kenichi, perfect timing

313
00:13:24,352 --> 00:13:25,852
My shoulders are really aching

314
00:13:25,893 --> 00:13:26,926
Give me a massage, okay?

315
00:13:26,967 --> 00:13:28,340
I'm in no mood to give massages!

316
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:30,134
Trying to save enough for that model train...

317
00:13:30,174 --> 00:13:31,367
has given me a huge headache!

318
00:13:31,547 --> 00:13:32,727
Ah, that's the spot

319
00:13:32,773 --> 00:13:34,154
You're really being a brat!

320
00:13:34,194 --> 00:13:35,359
I've noticed lately...

321
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:37,947
you haven't been listening to Mum and Dad, being so disobedient!

322
00:13:37,987 --> 00:13:38,906
Yan...

323
00:13:39,281 --> 00:13:40,492
Oh, it was Hattori-kun?

324
00:13:40,533 --> 00:13:41,580
Thanks so much!

325
00:13:41,621 --> 00:13:42,740
Stop massaging him!

326
00:13:42,977 --> 00:13:44,797
Hattori-kun, don't steal my business!

327
00:13:44,838 --> 00:13:45,763
Did you hear me?

328
00:13:45,804 --> 00:13:48,470
I'm here specially to serve the customer, let me do the massage!

329
00:13:49,108 --> 00:13:49,860
Excuse me, sir

330
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:52,348
Deluxe, Basic, or Standard—which one would you like?

331
00:13:52,936 --> 00:13:54,236
What do you mean by that?

332
00:13:54,276 --> 00:13:56,832
Deluxe is 200 yen for shoulders and feet

333
00:13:56,872 --> 00:13:58,741
Standard is 100 yen for shoulders

334
00:13:58,781 --> 00:14:00,154
And Basic is 50 yen for a quick rub

335
00:14:00,195 --> 00:14:01,914
Then I'll take Basic

336
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,341
But Deluxe is our best service!

337
00:14:03,381 --> 00:14:04,433
I want Basic!

338
00:14:04,892 --> 00:14:06,538
Alright, fine... Thanks for your business

339
00:14:06,579 --> 00:14:08,318
Wow, your shoulders are so stiff!

340
00:14:08,359 --> 00:14:10,378
Kenichi, go run an errand and buy some things for me

341
00:14:10,419 --> 00:14:12,326
Oh no, I'm only halfway through the job

342
00:14:12,366 --> 00:14:13,226
Oh well, never mind

343
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:16,092
Hey, give me the 50 yen

344
00:14:16,133 --> 00:14:17,299
What, you're done already?

345
00:14:17,339 --> 00:14:19,060
It's charged every five minutes!

346
00:14:19,108 --> 00:14:20,954
Why not choose a different service?

347
00:14:20,995 --> 00:14:22,569
How about Standard this time?

348
00:14:22,941 --> 00:14:24,841
Fine, whatever, let's just do that!

349
00:14:24,882 --> 00:14:26,279
Thank you for your business!

350
00:14:29,788 --> 00:14:31,628
Let's do Deluxe one more time!

351
00:14:37,049 --> 00:14:38,549
Alright, time's up again

352
00:14:38,596 --> 00:14:40,507
How about another round of Deluxe?

353
00:14:40,548 --> 00:14:42,180
Oh, that's quite enough!

354
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:43,466
Ugh, what a total cheapskate!

355
00:14:43,507 --> 00:14:44,767
Thanks a lot anyway!

356
00:14:45,664 --> 00:14:46,284
Mum

357
00:14:46,324 --> 00:14:47,564
I'll run that errand for you!

358
00:14:47,604 --> 00:14:48,860
For premium, I ride a bike

359
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:50,664
Standard is running, and economy is walking

360
00:14:50,705 --> 00:14:53,133
No need, Hattori-kun already went and bought it for me

361
00:14:54,369 --> 00:14:55,629
I'm back

362
00:14:56,089 --> 00:14:57,223
You're back?

363
00:14:57,663 --> 00:14:59,130
Thanks for your hard work

364
00:14:59,170 --> 00:15:00,603
Here, a tip for you

365
00:15:00,736 --> 00:15:02,580
Thank you, Mom

366
00:15:02,969 --> 00:15:04,063
Oh, Hattori-kun!

367
00:15:04,104 --> 00:15:05,837
He's such a busybody, getting in the way of my fortune

368
00:15:05,877 --> 00:15:07,722
Hey, go buy me a pack of cigarettes

369
00:15:07,762 --> 00:15:09,067
I'm on it!

370
00:15:09,115 --> 00:15:10,287
Thanks a lot

371
00:15:11,228 --> 00:15:12,601
Let me go get it

372
00:15:13,032 --> 00:15:14,945
Yan...

373
00:15:14,986 --> 00:15:17,591
Yan...

374
00:15:18,306 --> 00:15:19,368
Buying cigarettes!

375
00:15:19,409 --> 00:15:20,795
Yan...

376
00:15:20,882 --> 00:15:22,754
Yan...

377
00:15:22,851 --> 00:15:24,414
I'm back!

378
00:15:28,848 --> 00:15:30,762
Back already?

379
00:15:31,375 --> 00:15:32,755
Here's a tip for you

380
00:15:32,902 --> 00:15:34,761
-Thank you
-Argh, this is infuriating!

381
00:15:34,802 --> 00:15:35,770
Dad

382
00:15:35,810 --> 00:15:37,537
I told you to fix the water pipe

383
00:15:37,577 --> 00:15:38,809
Looks like you haven't finished yet

384
00:15:38,850 --> 00:15:40,743
No worries, let me fix it

385
00:15:40,916 --> 00:15:42,049
Yan...

386
00:15:47,866 --> 00:15:50,373
Yan...

387
00:15:51,638 --> 00:15:54,820
I'm so mad! Why does Hattori-kun always have to go against me?

388
00:15:56,322 --> 00:15:58,077
Thank you, you did a great job

389
00:15:58,118 --> 00:16:00,036
Not only was it fast, it was done properly too

390
00:16:00,076 --> 00:16:02,175
Unlike Kenichi, who bargains at every turn

391
00:16:02,216 --> 00:16:04,664
Mom, it's time for us to head out

392
00:16:04,970 --> 00:16:06,651
Oh right, Kenichi

393
00:16:06,691 --> 00:16:08,588
I'm heading out with Dad to do some shopping now

394
00:16:08,628 --> 00:16:10,221
Be a good boy and watch the house

395
00:16:10,747 --> 00:16:11,881
Yan...

396
00:16:12,113 --> 00:16:14,200
Starting today, there's a big sale

397
00:16:14,241 --> 00:16:16,435
Please leave all the housework to me

398
00:16:16,688 --> 00:16:18,758
Alright, you two do it together

399
00:16:19,299 --> 00:16:20,266
Alright, we're off

400
00:16:20,306 --> 00:16:22,626
Watching the house by myself is plenty

401
00:16:22,666 --> 00:16:24,292
Hattori-kun, go out and play

402
00:16:24,512 --> 00:16:26,576
I need to find a job

403
00:16:27,229 --> 00:16:29,423
Yan...

404
00:16:29,463 --> 00:16:30,670
I'm here to apply

405
00:16:30,829 --> 00:16:32,220
What kind of work do you want to do?

406
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:34,004
I want to earn some extra cash

407
00:16:34,044 --> 00:16:35,231
Alright then

408
00:16:35,271 --> 00:16:37,558
I'll give you a chance to try it out

409
00:16:38,896 --> 00:16:40,540
Deliver this bowl to East Main Street

410
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:42,016
To Mr. Hina's place, and make it quick

411
00:16:42,057 --> 00:16:43,564
Just one bowl?

412
00:16:45,871 --> 00:16:46,970
Bring it on

413
00:16:48,469 --> 00:16:49,890
Not enough

414
00:16:50,682 --> 00:16:52,029
More!

415
00:16:57,300 --> 00:16:58,891
Yan...

416
00:16:59,210 --> 00:17:00,763
Whoa...

417
00:17:00,804 --> 00:17:01,822
Out of the way...

418
00:17:01,863 --> 00:17:02,660
Oh no, I can't stop!

419
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:04,663
Hurry, move aside! Don't get in the way!

420
00:17:07,249 --> 00:17:09,055
Yan...

421
00:17:09,775 --> 00:17:11,195
Phew, I'm back!

422
00:17:11,455 --> 00:17:12,529
You delivered them all already?

423
00:17:12,569 --> 00:17:13,629
All delivered!

424
00:17:13,728 --> 00:17:15,276
Oh, that makes no sense

425
00:17:15,922 --> 00:17:17,836
You're trying to fool me, but you can't!

426
00:17:17,877 --> 00:17:19,036
You're fired!

427
00:17:19,077 --> 00:17:20,785
Fine, don't believe me then

428
00:17:22,435 --> 00:17:23,635
He makes me so mad!

429
00:17:25,454 --> 00:17:27,968
No doubt about it, they're calling to complain

430
00:17:29,614 --> 00:17:31,068
My, your service

431
00:17:31,109 --> 00:17:32,641
It was really fast and reliable!

432
00:17:34,128 --> 00:17:35,388
Hello...

433
00:17:35,915 --> 00:17:36,940
I'm so sorry!

434
00:17:37,168 --> 00:17:38,269
It was all my fault

435
00:17:38,310 --> 00:17:40,743
I'll pay you double, please stay on!

436
00:17:40,784 --> 00:17:42,609
I was waiting for my wages so I could...

437
00:17:42,650 --> 00:17:44,564
Thank you so much, Boss!

438
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:49,487
Why isn't Hattori-kun back yet so late?

439
00:17:49,528 --> 00:17:50,721
Where on earth could he have gone?

440
00:17:50,865 --> 00:17:52,944
I'm not him, how should I know where he went?

441
00:17:52,985 --> 00:17:54,436
I'm home!

442
00:17:54,476 --> 00:17:56,163
Sorry I'm late!

443
00:17:56,469 --> 00:17:57,990
Kenichi, here's a present for you!

444
00:17:58,030 --> 00:18:00,076
- It's just a small token of my appreciation
- For me?

445
00:18:01,149 --> 00:18:02,469
What could it be?

446
00:18:05,862 --> 00:18:07,483
So Hattori-kun was working so hard

447
00:18:07,524 --> 00:18:10,463
to earn extra money to buy
this toy for me, wasn't he?

448
00:18:10,503 --> 00:18:11,582
That's right!

449
00:18:12,662 --> 00:18:16,069
Hattori-kun, you're the best! I'm so touched!

450
00:18:16,122 --> 00:18:19,614
We're good friends after all, no need to be so polite!

